name issue_12_lossbwe_shallow
describe Shallow buffer: 1.5 Mbps with a 20 ms drop-tail queue; the loss-based estimate must keep backing off (#12)
duration 40s
at 0s capacity=1500kbps delay=30ms queue=20ms
# 5 seeds (cc v2): net.loss_pct 8.2-14.7, freeze_total_ms 413-964, utilization 59-70 %. `cc v1`: loss 10.2-17.6 %.
expect net.loss_pct < 16
# Was < 1500. Guard rail during a port (program.md 0.2, #217): with the RTCP report interval from the sender's whole
# send rate (RtpSenderEgress::GetSendRates(now).Sum()), seed 1 freezes 2155 ms (10 seeds: mean 2023, 9.6 freezes;
# libwebrtc 1740, 8.9). libwebrtc fails < 1500 on 7 of 10 seeds (parity-data: 2367 1817 2720 1728 376 1771 1265 1520
# 1731 2101). Bound per the Owner rule on PR #216: just above our seed-1 value, below libwebrtc's worst seed (2720).
expect video.freeze_total_ms < 2200
expect cc.utilization_pct >= 55
expect audio.interruptions <= 3
